eoPoint- Global#GlideGeoPoint - getGeoPoint\\(String geo\\_point\\_field\\_name\\)#{1}":[139,191],"#GlideGeoPoint- Global#GlideGeoPoint - getLatitude\\(\\)":[192,218],"#GlideGeoPoint- Global#GlideGeoPoint - getLatitude\\(\\)#{1}":[194,218],"#GlideGeoPoint- Global#GlideGeoPoint - getLongitude\\(\\)":[219,244],"#GlideGeoPoint- Global#GlideGeoPoint - getLongitude\\(\\)#{1}":[221,244],"#GlideGeoPoint- Global#GlideGeoPoint - getValue\\(\\)":[245,270],"#GlideGeoPoint- Global#GlideGeoPoint - getValue\\(\\)#{1}":[247,270],"#GlideGeoPoint- Global#GlideGeoPoint - setValue\\(String longitude, String latitude\\)":[271,295],"#GlideGeoPoint- Global#GlideGeoPoint - setValue\\(String longitude, String latitude\\)#{1}":[273,295],"#GlideGeoPoint- Global#GlideGeoPoint - setValue\\(String value\\)":[296,321],"#GlideGeoPoint- Global#GlideGeoPoint - setValue\\(String value\\)#{1}":[298,321]},"outlinks":[{"title":"GlideGeoPoint Developer Guide","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/developer-guides/geopoint-dev-guide.md","line":26},{"title":"Geo point field type","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/geo-point-field-type.md","line":38},{"title":"Function field","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/platform-support-functions.md","line":38},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":40},{"title":"GlideGeoPoint Developer Guide","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/developer-guides/geopoint-dev-guide.md","line":113}],"metadata":{"title":"GlideGeoPoint - Global","description":"The GlideGeoPoint API enables you to get and set geopoint data type values in a table.Instantiates a GlideGeoPoint object. The GlideGeoPoint object adds semantic awareness to longitude and latitude values that are otherwise stored as strings.Instantiates the GlideGeoPoint object according to provided longitude and latitude values.Copies longitude and latitude points values to instantiate a new GlideGeoPoint object.Returns the geopoint of the current user in a user-friendly format.Returns a list of geo point coordinate values for a given field name of type geo point.Returns the latitude value of the GlideGeoPoint object.Returns the longitude value of the GlideGeoPoint object.Returns a string containing the programmatic longitude and latitude value of the current GlideGeoPoint object.Sets the longitude and latitude values of the geopoint.Sets the longitude and latitude values of the geopoint using a single comma-delimited value.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideGeopointGlobalAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":5,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[52,54],[71,75],[79,81],[97,101],[105,107],[123,128],[132,135],[174,182],[186,190],[204,210],[214,217],[231,236],[240,243],[257,262],[266,269],[284,288],[292,294],[310,313],[317,319]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideGeopointGlobalAPI.md"},
